      "message": "There\u0027s no need to cycle through the app-ids.  Also, just disable hidden-key usage, set these to zero: KEYMGR_AES_USE_HIDDEN_KEY_ENABLE, KEYMGR_SHA_USE_HIDDEN_KEY_ENABLE.",
